/*Question 1: Your boss has asked you to determine which books by which authors are currently being used in the company's economics curricula.
In other words, show the textbook titles, author IDs, and author names for current economics textbooks. Only show textbooks that have authors in our database.
We're going to break this question down into three parts:
1: Find the titles of the books that are currently being used in economics.
2: Find the author IDs associated with these economics textbooks.
3: Find the names of the authors who wrote the textbooks.*/

/*Part #1 Instructions: Find the titles of the current economics books. In other words, what are the titles of books that have the subject ‘Economics' and a ‘Yes’ for Current?
1: Find the titles of the books that are currently being used in economics.*/ 
SELECT Textbooks.Title
FROM Textbooks
WHERE Subject = "Economics" 
AND Current = "Yes"; 


/*Part #2 Instructions: Find the author IDs for economics textbooks that have authors. Your results should include the textbook name and author ID. 
2: Find the author IDs associated with these economics textbooks.*/ 
SELECT AuthorTextbookLink.AuthorID, Textbooks.Title
FROM Textbooks 
JOIN AuthorTextbookLink
ON Textbooks.TextbookID = AuthorTextbookLink.TextbookID 
WHERE Subject = "Economics"; 


/*Part #3 Instructions: Find the names of the authors who wrote these economics textbooks. Your answer should include the textbook name, author ID, and the author’s name. 
Find the names of the authors who wrote the textbooks.*/
SELECT Authors.AuthorID, Authors.Name, Textbooks.Title
FROM Textbooks
INNER JOIN AuthorTextbookLink
ON Textbooks.TextbookID = AuthorTextbookLink.TextbookID 
INNER JOIN Authors 
ON AuthorTextbookLink.AuthorID = Authors.AuthorID
WHERE Subject = "Economics"
AND Current = "Yes";
